    - target: {fileID: 3927313888169428688, guid: e9f8d042dba2e1b4b8e35418f1d8fc6d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Living only with the presence of my thoughts has become difficult...

        I
        turned away from friends and family in pursuit of greater glories.

        I
        wanted to change life, to make something great, to make a dent in the unyielding
        armor of society.

        Something more than my life''s worth.

        Something
        that the future generations would thank me of.

        But alas, now I know,
        I was a fool to tempt the powers of fate.

        I''ve steered my crew
        in danger''s way like the selfish being I swore to not become...

        All
        in the name of vanity.

        Now I stand, a lone survivor on a barren
        island.

        None shall know my story.

        None shall know my life''s
        work.

        None shall know my fate.

        Everything was for nothing...'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3986391344864574913, guid: e9f8d042dba2e1b4b8e35418f1d8fc6d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_SizeDelta.y
